(6240048, 923149, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute setup. I think I would have liked to see the photo just contain the lday. The elements on the right are distracting from the main subject.</td>', 'Cute setup. I think I would have liked to see the photo just contain the lday. The elements on the right are distracting from the main subject.', '2010-12-01 09:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240051, 922485, 114225, '<td valign="top">Yum! I really like this idea, but I think the setup could be improved slightly:<br/>* I think a more symmetrical positioning of the handles would help a lot.<br/>* Having the wood grain be at an angle makes the whole photo look tilted.<br/>* The highlights on the bananas are badly blown out.<br/> <br/>I hope these comments help!</td>', 'Yum! I really like this idea, but I think the setup could be improved slightly:* I think a more symmetrical positioning of the handles would help a lot.* Having the wood grain be at an angle makes the whole photo look tilted.* The highlights on the bananas are badly blown out. I hope these comments help!', '2010-12-01 09:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
